<title>RUSSIA: Russian GDP unchanged yr/yr in first four months.</title>
<headline>Russian GDP unchanged yr/yr in first four months.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian gross domestic product in the first four months of this year totalled 810 trillion roubles, which was unchanged from a year earlier in inflation- adjusted terms, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>GDP in the month of April was one percent lower than the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN GDP			  APR 97    MAR 97    APR 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	+0.4	+2	  +2</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  -1	  -0.1	-1</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
